[PrintTextModified Text:"（但结合我至今为止的所见所闻来判断，<br>　她说的话是真实的）|#0205Trial01_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……除了其中一部分）|#0205Trial01_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.2
[PrintTextModified Text:"（就让我来当面指出吧。<br>　她说的话与我所知信息之间存在的差异……！）|#0205Trial01_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

