[PrintTextModified Text:肉体的魔女化……<br>具体来说，会发生什么事呢？|#0205Trial01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile1,Mouth1_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:一开始程度不深，只会出现手指甲变长一类的情况……|#0205Trial01_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:但只要超过某个程度，<br>就会变得长生不死……|#0205Trial01_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Eyes1_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:这时候就算受了重伤，<br>也能随着时间流逝而痊愈……|#0205Trial01_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Arms1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:过去，<br>【貌似丑陋怪物的魔女形象】<br>在人类之间口耳相传……|#0205Trial01_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Arms1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:而魔女化正是重现了那虚构形象中的怪物。|#0205Trial01_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR11_1,ArmL12,Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Flushed_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:非常讽刺……对吧……<br>真可怜……|#0205Trial01_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（……没错。<br>　这就是魔女化）|#0205Trial01_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:（这就是目前正发生在我身上的现象……）|#0205Trial01_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（就算我去求别人说<br>　【请变成像我这样的怪物吧】，<br>　她们也绝不可能答应……）|#0205Trial01_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


